# PDP Versions (v1 frozen … v4 active)

Four comparison routes from **`main`**: **v1** `/v1` (frozen) · **v2** `/v2` (frozen) · **v3** `/v3` (frozen) · **v4** `/v4` (active).

Docs: `docs/pdp-versions.md` · `docs/deploy-and-links.md` · `docs/prototype-versions.md` · `docs/rounds/`

## Rules

- New round work → `src/components/pdp/version/` or flags in `pdp-version-config.ts`. Never rewrite v1/v2/v3 defaults.
- Do not branch on `version === "v2"|"v3"|"v4"`. Add a flag to `PdpVersionConfig`.
- Never edit `pdp-data.ts` or `pdp-section-chapters.ts` for new-round needs.
- Version-only CSS → `src/app/vN/pdp-vN.css` under `[data-pdp-version="vN"]`, not `globals.css`.
- Shared `pdp-v2-*` also render on `/v3`/`/v4` — gate v4-only layout behind v4 flags.
- After changes: spot-check older routes, then `pnpm check:versions`.
- Stakeholder share: pre-ship checklist in `docs/deploy-and-links.md`.

## Quick map

- `pdp-version-context.tsx` · `pdp-version-config.ts`
- v2: `pdp-data-v2.ts`, `pdp-section-chapters-v2.ts`
- v3: `pdp-v3-*.tsx` · v4: `pdp-v4-specs.ts`
- Boundaries: `scripts/check-pdp-version-boundaries.mjs`
